Access to CloudCore’s internal documentation and staff directory is limited to authorised project teams. Enter the access details provided by your unit coordinator.



&lt;label for="unit-gate-code" style="display:block; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:.4rem;"&gt;Unit Code&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;input type="text" id="unit-gate-code" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. ISYS6018"
       autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false" required&gt;


&lt;label for="unit-gate-password" style="display:block; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:.4rem;"&gt;Access Password&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;input type="password" id="unit-gate-password" class="form-control" required&gt;


Enter Portal





Trouble signing in? Contact your unit coordinator. Sessions last the teaching period on this browser.
